{
  "slug": "onplana",
  "name": "Onplana",
  "url": "https://mcp.onplana.com/mcp",
  "description": "Onplana is an AI-native project and portfolio management platform. This\nconnector lets Claude work directly with your Onplana workspace.\n\nRead and write projects, tasks, subtasks and dependencies. Manage sprints,\nepics, milestones and the backlog. Track risks, issues and ideas as\nfirst-class records rather than notes. Log and approve timesheets, set\nresource capacity, and read budgets, rate cards and earned-value metrics.\nDraft and read workspace documents, wikis and pages. Search across everything\nin the workspace with hybrid keyword and semantic search.\n\nFor organizations that run formal governance, the connector also covers the\nproposal pipeline with gate reviews, the change control board, portfolios,\ngoals and OKRs, and the compliance audit trail.\n\nOnplana is built for teams migrating off Microsoft Project Online before its\nretirement, and imports native Microsoft Project files, Project Online,\nPlanner and Project for the Web.\n\nEverything the connector does is scoped to one organization and to the\npermissions of the connected account. Destructive operations are disabled by\ndefault and an administrator must enable each one explicitly before an agent\ncan call it.",
